# Allowlist: the image gets only what demo/serve.py imports or serves. Everything else in the checkout (local data
# such as runtime/.data, tool caches, deploy metadata, results, site images, .env files) stays out of the image.
*
!backend
!demo
!experiments
!interlock
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.interlock
